This tree started from the duchamp (Redmi K70E / POCO X6 Pro) device tree by
mt6897-devs and has since been retargeted to degas against the stock HyperOS
OS3.0.306.0.WNEEUXM firmware.

Parts of it are taken or adapted from the degas device tree by Mikhail Mlhcnn
(https://github.com/degas-developers/android_device_xiaomi_degas), licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  init/degas-backlight-sync.sh
  init/init.project.rc            (collisionData truncation, ufs-bsg0)
  init/ueventd.xiaomi.rc          (cooling_device, ufs-bsg0)
  udfps/                          (UdfpsHandler.cpp, mi_disp.h, xiaomi_touch.h)
  sensors/UdfpsSensorSubHal.*
  configs/idc/goodix_ts.idc
  configs/media/                  (stock-derived codec/profile lists)
  configs/thermal_info_config.json
  overlay/DegasSystemUIOverlay, overlay/DegasSettingsOverlay,
  overlay/DegasWifiOverlay (SAE), overlay-lineage/LineageApertureOverlayDegas
  sepolicy/vendor/                (degas_backlight_sync, hal_face_default,
                                   hal_touchfeature_xiaomi, genfs nodes and
                                   the rules noted in the respective files)

These files were modified where needed to fit this tree.
